<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Temporarily Down</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: #0f172a;
            color: #fff;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 500px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        p {
            color: #cbd5f5;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .loader {
            margin: 20px auto;
            border: 4px solid #1e293b;
            border-top: 4px solid #38bdf8;
            border-radius: 50%;
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            animation: spin 1s linear infinite;
        }

        @keyframes spin {
            0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
            100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #94a3b8;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <h1>🚧</h1>
        <h2>We’re Under Maintenance</h2>
        <p>Our website is currently down for updates. We’ll be back shortly.</p>

        <div class="loader"></div>

        <div class="footer">
            &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> rarepenguin fashion
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
